  "body": "Currently, matrix.org is always prefilled at server selection.\r\nWhen I invite someone using my matrix.to link, it should have a parameter, that when opened with a logged-out Element, prefills the server name.\r\n\r\nUse case:\r\nSome servers provide way better performance than matrix.org\r\n\r\n1. New user installs Element\r\n2. Opens my matrix.to link, e.g. https://matrix.to/#/@notramo:grin.hu?recommend_hs=grin.hu\r\n3. Server selector is prefilled with grin.hu\r\n",
